# Frames that never reach the screen are not judged as drops (LIF-2 / S3D-2): the Mac test verb link_inactive does what iOS does on resign
# (the present link paused, focus 2), so every present falls back and reads "not shown" (-1). Frame Drops used to count those as drops and
# stepped down while nothing was on screen (the negative control: RED on the unfixed controller). DM_TEST_Q3D=0 turns the controller on (the
# Mac's default is Keep); the 22 s in game get past the 20 s entry hold, and 40 s inactive would give it four 10 s windows to step in.
name inactive_present
requires cli
save warlock
timeout 240
env DM_TEST_Q3D=0

enter_game
stick 1 0 frames=30
sleep 22
app link_inactive
sleep 40
app link_active
expect perf timeout=25
log skip the first window after becoming active: it still holds frames from before
expect perf shown=true timeout=25
quit
check no_red
check no_red_log
check no_event scale3d lv=1
